el_not_found","sales_funnel_catalogue_unavailable","campaign_service_unconfigured","campaign_service_unavailable","runs_service_unavailable","no_proactive_pipe","volume_not_measured_on_channel","sourcing_catalogue_unavailable","sales_funnel_campaign_not_found",null]},"consumedUnavailableDetail":{"type":"string","nullable":true}},"required":["count","period","unit","periodStart","periodEnd","consumed","remaining","reached","consumedUnavailableReason","consumedUnavailableDetail"],"description":"unit first_contacts: consumed = first contacts the funnel's PROACTIVE pipes made in the window (cold email: the first email of each prospect's sequence, completed or in flight). unit prospects_handled (all pipes reactive): consumed = prospects the FIRST reactive pipe took on (AI meeting booking: workflow runs that called the LLM; AI Follow-up Email: each email sent to one person). Any channel whose leg PRODUCES a step with a declared run (email_sent: one email sent), or whose reactive funnel fires on a trigger with a declared run (email_pushed_via_api: one email sent, Email Sending), is measured by that run, no per-channel entry. unit outcomes_produced: consumed = produced outcomes of the pipe's step (threads_post_published: one Threads thread; x_post_published / linkedin_post_published: one post; industry_update_video: one video) declared on runs-service's ledger on runs of the counted campaigns in the window. A channel with no measure yet answers null + volume_not_measured_on_channel. unit null = the funnel is unreadable."},"salesFunnelName":{"type":"string","nullable":true},"salesFunnelType":{"type":"string","nullable":true,"enum":["proactive","reactive",null],"description":"features-service's served funnel type, RELAYED (never derived here): proactive when at least one pipe is proactive, else reactive. Labels the caps: proactive = Max budget / Max volume, reactive = Up to $X / Up to N."},"salesFunnelTypeUnavailab","note":"Narrow the request (a filter, a limit, one id) to re